toy from TOMY. Sure to be another big toy of 2016. This hushed voiceover style by Guy Harris. Check the website.\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container page-header-nav-wrap","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-content","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Greedy Granny TV Commercial"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>TOMY called wanting a voice for the Greedy Granny TV Commercial.</p>"}}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-arrows","children":[null,null]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Check out the video</h2>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>In 2016 I voiced many Kid's TV adverts and rapidly becoming more well known for doing so. <br>\r\nUsually the brief asks for energy and excitement, something I find rather easy to deliver.<br>\r\nJust like <a href=\"/pop-up-pirate-voiceover\" title=\"Pop-up Pirate\">Pop-up Pirate</a>, it's always a pleasure working with TOMY.</p>"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/lifY6wSIbO8","title":"Greedy Granny TV Commercial","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-img-card","children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/greedy-granny-tv-commercial.jpg","alt":"Greedy Granny TV Commercial","className":"blog-post-img"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-post-img-caption","children":"Greedy Granny TV Commercial"}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>So you want to know more about Greedy Granny?</h2>\r\n<p><em>Granny loves biscuits! So much so that she's fallen asleep with a whole tray of them on her lap. Your mission is to take a biscuit of each type from Granny's tray as carefully and quietly as you can. One wrong move will wake her and send her teeth flying! Greedy Granny is a new and mischievous game from <a href=\"https://uk.tomy.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"TOMY\">TOMY</a>. Greedy Granny is full of suspense and will have everyone on the edge of their seats. Will you risk it for a biscuit? Or will your move wake Granny?</em></p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>Do you have a <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">TV commercial or promo in need of a voice</a>? A style hushed or whispered one similar to this Greedy Granny TV Commercial? Please get in touch. To make the process even easier, just let me know the intended usage of the production and I can quote you more accurately. Send a short sample of the script and I'll send you a short audition. Check to see if my voice is right for your show or project. Please do get in touch today.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"Greedy Granny TV Commercial","pageUrl":"greedy-granny-tv-commercial"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","993",{"href":"/motor-sport-racing-commentator-voice","className":"blog-related-card","children